# Build context for the .NET Containerfiles (src/ProxyManager*, context = repo root).
# Allowlist: everything is excluded unless re-included below, so new files at the repo root
# (secrets, logs, tooling config) stay out of the build by default. The UI has its own context
# (src/ProxyManager.UI) and its own .containerignore.
*
!global.json
!src/

# Inside src/: never send build output, local runtime state or private material.
src/ProxyManager.UI
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/logs
**/certs
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.env*
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/.DS_Store
**/*.http
